sequenceDiagram
    participant "Hangfire Scheduler" as HangfireScheduler
    participant "Backend Service Host" as BackendServiceHost
    participant "Primary Database" as PrimaryDatabase
    actor "OpenAI Embedding API" as OpenAIEmbeddingAPI
    participant "Amazon OpenSearch Serverless" as AmazonOpenSearchServerless

    activate BackendServiceHost
    HangfireScheduler->>BackendServiceHost: 1. 1. Trigger recurring job: IUserEmbeddingJob.ProcessBatch()
    BackendServiceHost->>BackendServiceHost: 2. 1.1. Identify batch of users requiring embedding updates
    BackendServiceHost-->>BackendServiceHost: List<Guid> userIds
    BackendServiceHost->>PrimaryDatabase: 3. 2. FOR EACH userId: FetchUserContextDataAsync(userId)
    PrimaryDatabase-->>BackendServiceHost: UserContextData (ReadingHistory, Goals, Vocabulary)
    BackendServiceHost->>BackendServiceHost: 4. 3. Transform and concatenate fetched data into text chunks
    BackendServiceHost-->>BackendServiceHost: List<string> textChunks
    BackendServiceHost->>OpenAIEmbeddingAPI: 5. 4. FOR EACH chunk: POST /v1/embeddings
    OpenAIEmbeddingAPI-->>BackendServiceHost: 200 OK with JSON body containing embedding vector
    BackendServiceHost->>AmazonOpenSearchServerless: 6. 5. client.IndexDocumentAsync(embeddingDocument)
    AmazonOpenSearchServerless-->>BackendServiceHost: IndexResponse (Success/Failure)
    BackendServiceHost->>BackendServiceHost: 7. 6. Log job completion status and metrics

    note over BackendServiceHost: Rate Limiting: A client-side rate limiter (e.g., using a token bucket algorithm) must be implemen...
    note over AmazonOpenSearchServerless: Idempotency: The embedding documents in OpenSearch should have a unique ID derived from the user ...

    deactivate BackendServiceHost
